      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm trying to upgrade old SDK2 projects to the latest Unity version (as a step to eventually migrate all content to current SDK).  These errors are present on all migrations.  You cannot open the build panel to upload.\nIf you want users to upgrade and migrate their projects, this is a complete blocker for most.",
