      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Anyone running into this error, here is a workaround:\n- Reimport sdk every time you open the project, to allow opening sdk control panel\n- Import Mathematics, and Burst from unity package manager\n(This does add very very  large and unneccessary libraries to your world projects, as its for avatar dynamics and not relevant to worlds, yet)",
